WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.200
My name is Luka Perković, and I'm the mid-laner for G2 Esports.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.900
I actually never had goals of
actually going pro.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:25.340
I had goals of living the normal life or just
going to school you know playing games

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:29.970
for fun. I started watching some LCS and
it's just like fun to watch these games

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:34.620
and this pro players. I climbed in
solo queue and at one point when I

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:39.570
joined the G2 challenger team, and it was, again I didn't want to go pro.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.989
I just wanted to get some money you know. It was like my school summer break

00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:45.869
and I was like oh, free money if I'm good.

00:00:45.869 --> 00:00:52.109
Trick comes in for some relief pitching the pitches on. Hybrid getting chomped.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:57.380
And now Perkz gets a killing spree to pick up Amazing. Looks for power, and that's a double kill for the fish.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:02.540
My parents knew that I was really the game and I found a way to basically do exams in the

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.190
off-season, so we found a compromise.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:17.280
So we qualified with the lineup: Hybrid, Jesse, Smittyj and Kikis as jungle that was like

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:22.360
a pretty special lineup. In the off-season we made some roster changes some people didn't

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:26.650
really like to play with each other and
it was a miracle that we won in relegation.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:29.229
We didn't even know the lineup for a long
time. We didn't know if Kikis was going to stay

00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:33.490
jungle or he wanted to role swap. My only aim was like top 4 or something.

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:36.370
Yeah I guess we exceeded all the
expectations.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:51.580
I didn't really get affected by people's opinions like on Reddit or whatever about MSI

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:55.660
or my performance or teams performance at MSI because I knew how I felt

00:01:55.660 --> 00:02:01.690
and how I played. After MSI I guess
I wanted to prove people again

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:05.410
Everyone was trash talking us
like oh, G2 is going to be shit

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:09.350
G2 vacation blah blah blah. And now we are first again.

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:15.760
It'll be very hard for G2 to play here. Power of Evil. Perkz actually turning on Power of Evil in the mid lane

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:19.480
he's going to flash away but the ignite will take him down but the first blood over to Perkz.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:24.420
The complete meta change and members
change and roster change made us play

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:29.320
a bit different at beginning and
meta was like, mid centric so I had a hard time

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.780
Not really a hard time, but it took me some time to realize how the meta is different

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:38.100
and how I should play a lot more safe and smarter.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:49.720
I would like to play SKT and RNG because I think at MSI we got stomped

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:55.320
by SKT both games but versus RNG
we were both games ahead and we could have easily won versus them.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:00.160
I actually just want to win versus RNG. I want a revenge versus RNG.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:04.880
I just want to play the best Korean and Chinese teams and i would like to face TSM actually.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:09.280
TSM is like, so good in NA and they're very good players

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.720
and very good mid laners, so I'm looking forward to playing those teams.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.770
In the end he's still going to drop and Perkz the triple kill.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:25.080
What! The quadra kill coming in, this man 1v5 the Vladimir.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:30.400
Right now, we are a completely different team. We play only straight macro game and we don't go

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:36.340
for clueless team fighting like before so
that's I guess what I learned from my first split

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:41.380
Clueless aggression is not good, that's why I got punished for it even in finals.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.080
I've known them for a very long
time, I have known their personalities

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.060
and I knew how good of players they were. Like, we trust each other and can

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.300
always say like criticism or I don't
think the champ is good or maybe strong

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:53.260
and blah blah

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:58.500
now everything is going by the plan we
are improving so much, playing a complete

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:02.930
objective game and there are barely any stupid mistakes.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.750
G2 is going to win Worlds, so we're going to make up for it.

